// leagues (tiered into Elite / Rise / Foundation), a matching set of real
// head coaches/managers, and a large pool of real professional players
// used to seed the free-agent pool that gets auctioned off tier-by-tier.
//
// Notes on realism / limits, so nobody mistakes this for a licensed
// database:
//  - Player attributes (pace/shooting/etc.) are NOT real ratings from any
//    game or dataset — they're generated by the existing engine, just
//    steered by a rough quality tier (S/A/B/C/D) based on reputation.
//  - Squads/transfers reflect general knowledge and will drift out of
//    date as real transfer windows happen — this is a simulation, not a
//    live feed.
//  - "Head Physio" / "Head of Medical" names are NOT real people. Actual
//    club medical staff aren't public data, so these are plausible
//    placeholder names, clearly a different tier of realism than the
//    clubs/managers/players.

